==English==
[[Image:Diskettenlaufwerk.jpg|thumb|A floppy drive for 3½-inch diskettes]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A computer [[hardware]] device used for reading and writing on removable [[floppy disk]]s, such as 3.5", 5.25" or 8" [[diskette]]s.

